        "content": "from pipeline.blocking import block, score, combine, match, MIN_MATCH_CONFIDENCE\n\nclass TestBlock:\n    def test_exact_external_id_match_found_before_embedding_pass(self):\n        ...  # two entities sharing external_id must appear as a candidate pair\n\n    def test_no_candidates_when_sides_share_nothing(self):\n        assert block([], []) == []\n\n    def test_never_produces_all_pairs_on_large_input(self):\n        # the O(n·k) contract: with top_k=10 and 1000x1000 entities, candidate\n        # count must be bounded by top_k * len(side_b), not len(a)*len(b)\n        ...\n\nclass TestScoreAndCombine:\n    def test_identical_entities_score_near_one(self): ...\n    def test_combine_below_min_confidence_is_excluded_by_match(self):\n        # entities that score under MIN_MATCH_CONFIDENCE must not appear in match()\n        ...\n\nclass TestMatch:\n    def test_is_pure_produces_no_side_effects(self):\n        # calling match() twice with the same input yields identical output\n        ...\n```\n\n```python\n",
