        "title": "engine/tests/pipeline/test_detect.py (extends the file above)",
        "content": "from pipeline.detect import classify\n\nclass TestClassify:\n    def test_parent_external_id_disagreement_is_structural_severity_4(self):\n        assert classify(\"parentExternalId\", \"ACC-1\", \"ACC-2\") == (\"structural\", 4)\n\n    def test_territory_disagreement_is_attribute_severity_3(self):\n        assert classify(\"territory\", \"APAC\", \"EMEA\") == (\"attribute\", 3)\n\n    def test_role_name_disagreement_is_attribute_severity_3(self):\n        assert classify(\"roleName\", \"AE\", \"SDR\") == (\"attribute\", 3)\n\n    def test_other_field_disagreement_is_attribute_severity_2(self):\n        assert classify(\"industry\", \"Tech\", \"Finance\") == (\"attribute\", 2)\n\n    def test_values_folding_to_same_form_are_cosmetic_severity_1(self):\n        assert classify(\"name\", \"Acme Inc.\", \"ACME INC\") == (\"cosmetic\", 1)\n\n    def test_identical_values_is_not_a_conflict_or_is_cosmetic(self):\n        # AGENTS.md doesn't explicitly say — pin down the actual contract here\n        ...\n\nclass TestDetect:\n    def test_duplicate_is_always_severity_4_regardless_of_confidence(self): ...\n    def test_unmatched_entity_on_side_a_becomes_orphan_conflict(self): ...\n    def test_unmatched_entity_on_side_b_becomes_orphan_conflict(self): ...\n    def test_matches_with_no_field_disagreement_produce_no_conflicts(self): ...\n```\n\n```python\n",
